ry = 'money transfer problem'  (expected concept: 'billing'\n  TF-IDF top-1 -> Subject: Peripheral compatibility\n                  Desc   : A customer A customer is an entity authorized to sell, exchange, provide for a specified transfer an\n  GloVe  top-1 -> Subject: Peripheral compatibility\n                  Desc   : A customer A customer is an entity authorized to sell, exchange, provide for a specified transfer an\n\nExample 2: Query = 'device wont start'  (expected concept: 'turning on'\n  TF-IDF top-1 -> Subject: Delivery problem\n                  Desc   : This is a problem using the latest version of Microsoft Access, or any of the various update solutio\n  GloVe  top-1 -> Subject: Software bug\n                  Desc   : Step You are now ready to start. I've recently updated the firmware of my Microsoft Surface, and the\n\nExample 3: Query = 'lost all my files'  (expected concept: 'data loss'\n  TF-IDF top-1 -> Subject: Product compatibility\n                  Desc   : My crashed, and I lost all the data stored on it. Is there any way to recover the lost data?\n  GloVe  top-1 -> Subject: Refund request\n                  Desc   : My Nikon D crashed, and I lost all the data stored on it. Is there any way to recover the lost data?\n\nExample 4: Query = 'cant log into my profile'  (expected concept: 'account access'\n  TF-IDF top-1 -> Subject: Battery life\n                  Desc   : I'm using my account to view the following . No activity log in to this profile to check The issue I\n  GloVe  top-1 -> Subject: Network problem\n                  Desc   : If not please log in here. You may need to log in the following week to try to help.\n\nExample 5: Query = 'internet not connecting'  (expected concept: 'network problem'\n  TF-IDF top-1 -> Subject: Product compatibility\n                  Desc   : I'm having trouble connecting my to my home Wi Fi network. It doesn't detect any networks, although \n  GloVe  top-1 -> Subject: Account access\n                  Desc   : I'm having trouble connecting my Google Nest to my home Wi Fi network. It doesn't detect any network\n\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":311},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"## Gradio App — Interactive Hybrid Search Interface","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"import subprocess\nsubprocess.run([\"pip\", \"install\", \"gradio\", \"--quiet\"], check=True)\nprint(\"Gradio installed\")","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-03-15T23:08:24.484876Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-03-15T23:08:24.485187Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-03-15T23:08:27.739342Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-03-15T23:08:24.485146Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-03-15T23:08:27.738691Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"Gradio installed\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":312},{"cell_type":"code","source":"import gradio as gr\nfrom collections import Counter as _Counter\n\ndef predict_ticket_type(query):\n    \"\"\"Predict ticket type via top-5 majority vote.\"\"\"\n    scores   = hybrid_search(query, alpha=0.4)\n    top5_idx = torch.topk(scores, 5).indices.cpu().numpy()\n    types    = [df.iloc[i][\"Ticket Type\"] for i in top5_idx]\n    return _Counter(types).most_common(1)[0][0]\n\ndef gradio_search(query, alpha):\n    if not query.strip():\n        return \"Please enter a query.\", \"\"\n    scores   = hybrid_search(query, alpha=alpha)\n    top3_res = torch.topk(scores, 3)\n    pred_type = predict_ticket_type(query)\n    rows = []\n    for rank, (idx, score) in enumerate(\n            zip(top3_res.indices.cpu().numpy(),\n                top3_res.values.cpu().numpy()), 1):\n        row = df.iloc[idx]\n        resolution = str(row.get(\"Resolution\", \"N/A\")).strip()\n        if resolution in (\"nan\", \"\"):\n            resolution = \"No resolution recorded\"\n        rows.append(\n            f\"**Rank {rank}**  |  Score: {score:.4f}  |  Type: {row['Ticket Type']}\\n\"\n            f\"- **Subject**: {row['display_subject']}\\n\"\n            f\"- **Description**: {row['display_description'][:150]}\\n\"\n            f\"- **Resolution**: {resolution}\\n\"\n        )\n    return f\"**Predicted Ticket Type:** {pred_type}\", \"\\n---\\n\".join(rows)\n\nwith gr.Blocks(title=\"HSRIS\") as demo:\n    gr.Markdown(\"# Hybrid Semantic Retrieval & Intelligence System (HSRIS)\")\n    gr.Markdown(\"Enter a support ticket description, adjust alpha, and see top matching tickets.\")\n    with gr.Row():\n        with gr.Column(scale=2):\n            query_box = gr.Textbox(\n                label=\"Ticket Description\",\n                placeholder=\"e.g. my payment failed and I was charged twice\",\n                lines=3)\n            alpha_slider = gr.Slider(\n                minimum=0.0, maximum=1.0, value=0.4, step=0.05,\n                label=\"alpha — TF-IDF weight (0=pure semantic, 1=pure keyword)\")\n            search_btn = gr.Button(\"Search\", variant=\"primary\")\n        with gr.Column(scale=1):\n            type_output = gr.Markdown(label=\"Predicted Ticket Type\")\n    results_output = gr.Markdown(label=\"Top 3 Similar Past Resolutions\")\n    search_btn.click(\n        fn=gradio_search,\n        inputs=[query_box, alpha_slider],\n        outputs=[type_output, results_output])\n    gr.Examples(\n        examples=[\n            [\"payment failed and I was charged twice\", 0.4],\n            [\"my device is not turning on\", 0.4],\n            [\"cannot connect to wifi\", 0.6],\n            [\"lost all my data after update\", 0.3],\n            [\"account locked out cannot login\", 0.5],\n        ],\n        inputs=[query_box, alpha_slider])\n\ndemo.launch(share=True, debug=False)","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-03-15T23:08:27.740315Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-03-15T23:08:27.740663Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-03-15T23:08:28.792798Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-03-15T23:08:27.740639Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-03-15T23:08:28.792203Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"* Running on local URL:  http://127.0.0.1:7861\n* Running on public URL: https://118a97fa1f0d26c292.gradio.live\n\nThis share link expires in 1 week. For free permanent hosting and GPU upgrades, run `gradio deploy` from the terminal in the working directory to deploy to Hugging Face Spaces (https://huggingface.co/spaces)\n","output_type":"stream"},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":"<IPython.core.display.HTML object>","text/html":"<div><iframe src=\"https://118a97fa1f0d26c292.gradio.live\" width=\"100%\" height=\"500\" allow=\"autoplay; camera; microphone; clipboard-read; clipboard-write;\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div>"},"metadata":{}},{"execution_count":313,"output_type":"execute_result","data":{"text/plain":""},"metadata":{}}],"execution_count":313},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"## Summary\n\n| Component | Implementation |\n|---|---|\n| Label Encoding | Ordinal map for Ticket Priority (Low=0 ... Critical=3) |\n| One-Hot Encoding | Binary vectors for Ticket Channel, unseen category = zero vector |\n| Custom Tokenizer | Regex-based, lowercasing, noise removal |\n| BoW Vectorizer | Top 5,000 tokens, count vectors |\n| N-Gram Generator | Sliding window bigrams and trigrams |\n| TF-IDF | Smooth IDF from scratch, stored as torch.sparse tensor |\n| GloVe Embeddings | 200-d, loaded into torch.nn.Embedding, OOV = zero vector |\n| Sentence Embedding | TF-IDF weighted average (prevents semantic dilution) |\n| Hybrid Search | FinalScore = 0.4 * TF-IDF + 0.6 * GloVe |\n| Dual GPU | DataParallel batch similarity, timed over batch sizes 10 to 100 |\n| Evaluation | Precision@5 per ticket type + 5 qualitative semantic wins |\n| Gradio App | Query box + alpha slider + predicted type + top-3 resolutions |\n","metadata":{}}]}